Error checks

Lint:

npm run lint

Production build:

npm run build

The build should have no:

unresolved imports

missing exports

syntax errors

Sass errors

runtime-critical build errors

Browser:

F12 → Console

Prioritize errors originating from the application's own source.

Browser-extension messages such as contentscript.js, ObjectMultiplex or background-liveness are not automatically application errors.

Image troubleshooting

List physical files:

find public/images -maxdepth 1 -type f | sort

Find image references:

grep -RInE 'getImage|image:' src --include='*.js' --include='*.jsx'

Find direct paths:

grep -RInE '/images/' src --include='*.js' --include='*.jsx'

For every referenced physical image, confirm a matching file exists in public/images/.

A successful Vite build does not guarantee every runtime image file exists.

Development

