Do not use the Vite development server as the live production server.

HTTPS

Do not keep a local .pem certificate as normal V1 project architecture.

Local development can use:

http://localhost:5173

Production uses:

https://clientdomain.com

Production HTTPS/TLS is configured by the hosting/CDN/domain setup.

